> prod(x: u8 in 1..255) = gm(x, invc(x))
> one(x: u8 in 1..255) = 1
> equiv prod one
prod and one are equal on the domain of prod (exhaustive)
> inv2(x: u8) = invc(invc(x))
> ident(x: u8) = x
> equiv inv2 ident
inv2 and ident are equal on the domain of inv2 (exhaustive)
> range invc
range of invc -> u8:
  0..255   (256 distinct values)
  fits in u8
  over all 256 points of the domain
> prodbad(x: u8 in 1..255) = gm(x, invc(x)) + 1
> equiv prodbad one
prodbad and one differ at 255 points, e.g. x=1: 2 vs 1
